WEBVTT

00:09:58.597 --> 00:10:02.363
to try and deal with these patients
and their problems.

00:10:02.397 --> 00:10:04.730
So I think this has helped a lot.

00:10:04.763 --> 00:10:06.063
SR: I'm curious.

00:10:06.063 --> 00:10:08.063
So you're an entrepreneur,

00:10:08.097 --> 00:10:10.530
although maybe you don't consider
yourself one now,

00:10:10.563 --> 00:10:13.963
but you did start your company,
I've read, in a garage,

00:10:13.963 --> 00:10:19.663
which often you hear
as part of the start-up law,

00:10:19.663 --> 00:10:21.630
certainly here in the US.

00:10:21.663 --> 00:10:27.663
I'm curious what advice you might have
for a young biotech entrepreneur now.

00:10:28.363 --> 00:10:29.530
KMS: Well, you know,

00:10:29.563 --> 00:10:33.730
I would say this is the most
exciting time for a biotech start-up,